# Smoke test of the console and the input path. Runs on the device and on the Mac build (ui_shot --serve).
ping
status
expect page pattern
expect text P1.
# the top row buttons switch pages, the same Master page the 22 page ui_shot set renders
tap Master
idle
# idle means the queue is empty and the display has nothing to redraw, the list animations of the page run a bit longer
wait 800
idle
expect page master
expect text Master
expect text Saturation
shotcrc master_a
# a capture rebuilds every control (like Shift + power does on the device), the lists restart their animation: settle again
wait 800
idle
shot master.png
wait 800
idle
shotcrc master_b
# the screen of a second look is the screen of the first
shotcrc-save master_a master_crc.json
shotcrc-expect master_b master_crc.json 0
# Shift is a held key: a combination only works if the press is held while the other key is tapped
press Shift
tap Master
release Shift
idle
tap Pattern
idle
expect page pattern
enc 1
idle
cpu-reset
wait 1500
cpu-check smoke
peek lastUsedInstrument
hash-project
markers
